                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "30965235",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198071094634",
                            "num_reviews": 12,
                            "playtime_forever": 101,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 101,
                            "last_played": 1491412862
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "For some reason there are no reviews on this, so I decided to try the game and be the first.  This is a quick +- 1.7 hour experience with pretty simple gameplay, that is not why you buy this. You buy it because of the beautiful environment that you will constantly be surrounded in. Any fan of anime or even art styles like seen in 'The red turtle' will really appreciate the art style of this game. Going back and forth every now and again to complete your tasks (no spoilers) is made a lot more fun when you are walking between such beautiful backgrounds. Then every task that you complete will reward you with a beautiful cut scene. Story wise it is interesting enough to keep you wanting to know more and it isn't all explained by some prologue or anything that dumbs it down. The one negative thing I have to say is that the English version has quite a bit of spelling errors and incorrect sentence construction, though it didn't draw me out of the experience too much, especially since it is much more of a silent adventure.",
